The issue is that mypy is still complaining about returning Any. The problem is that when we do `_registry[name] = cast(Any, Counter(...))`, mypy sees that we're assigning an Any type to the dictionary, and then when we return `_registry[name]`, mypy thinks we're returning an Any.

I need to change the approach. Let me try using a Union type for the registry instead of Any.
